# Browser support floor for the web app.
#
# "Baseline widely available" = features supported across all core browsers for
# ~30 months — a modern, safe evergreen floor. This MIRRORS Vite's default
# `build.target: 'baseline-widely-available'`, which lowers JS (Oxc) and CSS, and
# drives Lightning CSS minification targets (the Vite 8 default CSS minifier).
#
# Vite core does not read this file directly; it's the conventional, tool-agnostic
# source of truth consumed by Tailwind v4's Lightning CSS engine and any future
# browserslist-aware tooling. Keep it conceptually in step with vite.config.ts's
# build target if you ever pin a different floor.
baseline widely available
